ve Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n108 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n0.51 Acres\n\nFreehold\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 20 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nK Talsania Sheetalnath Enclave in Malad West is a premier residential project that exemplifies the essence of luxury living. Designed to provide residents with a harmonious blend of comfort and style, the enclave features world-class residential units that cater to modern lifestyles. Each unit is thoughtfully crafted to meet the diverse needs and preferences of homeowners, ensuring a living space that is both functional and aesthetically pleasing.  \n  \nThis project boasts top-line specifications and an impressive array of amenities, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a convenient and upscale lifestyle. Residents can indulge in various facilities designed to enhance their living experience, from lush landscaped gardens to state-of-the-art fitness centers. The attention to detail in the design and execution of these amenities reflects the commitment to quality that K Talsania is known for.  \n  \nK Talsania Sheetalnath Enclave offers a vibrant community atmosphere that fosters a sense of belonging. With its strategic location in Malad West, residents enjoy easy access to essential services, entertainment hubs, and educational institutions. This project not only represents a home but a lifestyle that combines luxury, comfort, and convenience, making it an excellent investment for discerning homeowners\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of K Talsania Sheetalnath Enclave Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![1 BHK Flat in K Talsania Sheetalnath Enclave in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 813768](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/121416/BHK_Configuration/1-445-1728380064.webp)\n\n1 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n445 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.24 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in K Talsania Sheetalnath Enclave in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 813769](https://imgcdn.houssed.