ges":[]},{"url":"https://www.addressofchoice.com/k-talsania-shitalnath-malad-west-mumbai-p70914","title":"K Talsania Shitalnath Malad West Mumbai - Reviews, Price, Address, Photos 2","raw_content":"AOC is searching fo you …\n\n* [Home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/)\n/* [Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/property-for-sale) \n  + [Properties For Sale In Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/property-for-sale)\n  + [Apartments Flats Sale In Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/apartments-cpt5c1)\n  + [House/Villas for sale in Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/villas-cpt7c1)\n  + [Ready to Move Apartments in Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/ready-to-move-cps4c1)\n  + [Plots for Sale In Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/plots-cpt6c1)\n  + [K Talsania Construction Properties for Sale In Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/k-talsania-construction-in-mumbai-cdp8713i1)\n/* [Malad West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-malad-west-mumbai-l1442) \n  + [Properties For Sale In Malad West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-malad-west-mumbai-l1442)\n  + [Apartments Flats Sale In Malad West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/malad-west/apartments-lpt5l1442)\n  + [House/Villas for sale in Malad West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/malad-west/villas-lpt7l1442)\n  + [Ready to Move Apartments in Malad West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/malad-west/ready-to-move-lps4l1442)\n  + [Plots for Sale In Malad West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/malad-west/plots-lpt6l1442)\n/* K Talsania Shitalnath\n\n## K Talsania Shitalnath\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Malad West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-malad-west-mumbai-l1442) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: K Talsania Construction](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-k-talsania-construction-d8713)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Borivali, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra.\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 1.01 Cr to 1.86 Cr\\*\n\n![K Talsania Shitalnath](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/70914/1676022681_service3_(1).jpg \"K Talsania Shitalnath\")\n\n# K Talsania Shitalnath in Malad West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![K Talsania Shitalnath](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/70914/1676022681_service3_(1).jpg \"K Talsania Shitalnath\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 ,2 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 362 sqft - 668 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 108 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: 0.51 Acres\n* Possession: December, 2025\n* Rera: P51800034499\n\n## About\n\nK Talsania Shitalnath is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Malad West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 0.51 Acres, the project features 108 Units in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 1 BHK+1T, to 2 BHK+2T Apartments ranging from 362 sqft to 668 sqft. The address for the project is borivali, malad west, mumbai, maharashtra..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at K Talsania Shitalnath are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 BHK+1T units start at 362 sqft. The larger 2 BHK+2T Apartments go up to 668 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at K Talsania Shitalnath are designed to be accessible, with 1 BHK+1T units priced from 1.01 Cr and 2 BHK+2T Apartments from 1.86 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by K Talsania Construction, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800034499 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2025-12-17, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nK Talsania Shitalnath is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Garden. The security features include CCTV, Fire Alarm for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 0.51 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 108 Units, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 362 sqft to 668 sqft\n* Project Address: borivali, malad west, mumbai, maharashtra.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: K Talsania Construction\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800034499 Units\n* Possession Start: 2025-12-17\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV, Fire Alarm\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nK Talsania Shitalnath benefits from its location in Malad West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at K Talsania Shitalnath will begin in 2025-12-17, and the project is RERA registered under P51800034499 Units. Developed by K Talsania Construction, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\